e class=3D"bbCodeInline" data-xf-init=3D"copy-to-clipboard" data-copy-text=
=3D"schtasks.exe /Run /TN &quot;\Microsoft\Windows\Servicing\StartComponent=
Cleanup&quot;">schtasks.exe /Run /TN "\Microsoft\Windows\Servicing\StartCom=
ponentCleanup"</code></span><br>
</p><br>
<span class=3D"bbnum" style=3D"border-radius:5px;height:30px;text-align:cen=
ter;line-height:30px;background-color:#0167af;display:inline-block;color:#f=
ff;min-width:30px;">1</span> Open <b>Task Scheduler</b> (taskschd.msc).<br>
<br>
<span class=3D"bbnum" style=3D"border-radius:5px;height:30px;text-align:cen=
