ff;min-width:30px;">2</span> Navigate to and open the folder below in the l=
eft pane of Task Scheduler. (see screenshot below step 3)<br>
<br>
<div style=3D"margin-left: 20px"><b>Task Scheduler Library &gt; Microsoft &=
gt; Windows &gt; Servicing</b>=E2=80=8B</div><br>
