		<div class=3D"bbCodeBlock-expandContent js-expandContent ">
			I have also had Option Two fail to clear up reclaimable packages, and ot=
hers have reported the same. It seems to be due to an error in the package =
definition itself, and not something that DISM's RestoreHealth appear to be=
 able to fix. An in-place repair install will fix it though.
		</div>
		<div class=3D"bbCodeBlock-expandLink js-expandLink"><a role=3D"button" ta=
bindex=3D"0">Click to expand...</a></div>
	</div>
</blockquote><br>
<b>Reclaimable Packages</b> are the number of <b>superseded</b> packages on=
 the system that component cleanup can remove.<br>
<br>
Usually, option 4 is used to manually remove superseded packages.</div>
