<br>
Try it in Command prompt instead of Power Shell.<br>
It's a Command Prompt...  command.  <img src=3D"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/jo=
ypixels/assets/8.0/png/unicode/64/1f642.png" class=3D"smilie smilie--emoji"=
