=3D"C:\Windows\System32\WindowsPowerShell\v1.0\powershell.exe">C:\Windows\S=
ystem32\WindowsPowerShell\v1.0\powershell.exe</code></span><br>
<br>
<br>
Right click <b>cmd.exe</b> and choose:  Send to &gt; Desktop (create shortc=
ut)<br>
Then right click the shortcut and choose "Run as Administrator"<br>
Then right click the shortcut again and choose:  "Pin to Taskbar"<br>
<br>
